# The champion with its hover slot restored to artillery: the minimal
# merge of the evolve1 armor mix with the range answer its evolution
# traded away. The pinbase48 enemy-composition split (log 2026-09-12) is
# binary -- 39/39 wins against enemies that never field artillery, 0/9
# against the scout-plus-artillery opening -- and the parent
# close0-flame4 carries c_artillery in exactly the slot the CEM search
# turned into heavyTank, fitted on seed blocks where the artillery
# opening is rare enough for the 48-pair bar to miss a 0-for pocket.
# Every other knob is the champion's, so a paired diff prices the range
# answer alone.
name evolve1-g4m2-arty
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
